  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate an integrated electro-optic Mach-Zehnder modulator in thin-film lithium tantalate at 737 nm with record low V<jats:italic>\n      <jats:sub>\u03c0</jats:sub>\n    </jats:italic> L of 0.65 Vcm. An extinction ratio of 30 dB and a detector-limited operating bandwidth of 20 GHz was measured.</jats:p>",
